  "$comment": "Semantic validation is intentionally stricter than JSON Schema: booleans are not integers under this schema; the Python checker also enforces fixed-order validation, cumulative monotonicity, exact horizon termination, capacity, budget, action-accounting, and same-start paired comparison.",
